scripts/ - offline scripts for AmigaPython 2.7
==============================================

These run without a network stack and without Unix-only modules.

  beer.py         99 bottles of beer
  fact.py         Factorize integers
  makedir.py      Create nested drawers (Amiga paths OK)
  markov.py       Markov-chain text generator
  pi.py           Digits of pi (CPU-heavy; raise stack if needed)
  pp.py           Simple perl-like -n/-p/-e filter
  primes.py       Print primes
  unbirthday.py   Days since birth (interactive)

Removed for 2.7/Amiga: regex-based tools, mpzpi, morse/audiodev,
lpwatch, script/pty, mkrcs/symlink, MAIL/from, NNTP newslist, which.

Examples:

  Python beer.py
  Python primes.py
  Python makedir.py RAM:T/My/Nested/Drawer
  Python pi.py
